{"about_the_game":"Do you dream making a <strong>Silent Hill P.T.</strong> or <strong>Resident Evil 7</strong> style videogame?<br>Thanks to <strong>S2ENGINE HD - Haunted House DLC</strong> you will be able to build your own AAA quality horror game house environment.<br><br>This wonderful DLC includes models that are designed to create the interior and exterior of an horror house.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTENTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A wide variety of photorealistic quality models including several Level Of Details versions.<br></li><li> Every model has a variety of PBR textures and masks (for dirt, rust, etc..) that lets you an high level of customization.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979780/extras/hh-steam.gif?t=1619600299\" /><br></li><li> All emitting light objects (lamps, tv, etc...) are already composed with primary and secondary lights for easily setting-up game scene illumination<br></li><li> Wide variety of decorating elements such as blood decals and spider webs <br></li><li> Many objects included into the package are just ready for interacting with player (switches, doors, drawers)<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979780/extras/interaction_big2.gif?t=1619600299\" /></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/979780?t=1619600299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/979780?t=1619600299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1619600299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/979780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1619600299","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,